{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your own way through the wilderness: build a cozy cabin or take your tent to discover more. Retro vibes and evergreen optimism ensoul this survival adventure featuring clever craftables, curious critters, and a handful of inspiring landmarks tucked away throughout.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/extras/Firebow.gif?t=1746592045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survival Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search the world for resources and craft new items to help aid in your survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/extras/Bow2.gif?t=1746592045\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Frontier Living</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate your frontier home base by building advanced structures like the cache. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/extras/Build.gif?t=1746592045\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">World Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your tent to camp anywhere in the world, allowing you to hike to new locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/extras/Rain.gif?t=1746592045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Inspiring Landmarks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful waterfalls, mysterious mines and more will break up the survival gameplay, allowing you to reflect on your time in the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/extras/Ponder.gif?t=1746592045\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And More!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We'll be continuing to update this <strong>About</strong> section as we build out the features in <i>On My Own: New Frontier</i>, so be sure to <u><strong>Wishlist &amp; Follow</strong></u> for the latest news updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1693410?t=1746592045","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1693410?t=1746592045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746592045","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746592045","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your own way through the wilderness: build a cozy cabin or take your tent to discover more. Retro vibes and evergreen optimism ensoul this survival adventure featuring clever craftables, curious critters, and a handful of inspiring landmarks tucked away throughout.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/extras/Firebow.gif?t=1746592045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survival Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search the world for resources and craft new items to help aid in your survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/extras/Bow2.gif?t=1746592045\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Frontier Living</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate your frontier home base by building advanced structures like the cache. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/extras/Build.gif?t=1746592045\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">World Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your tent to camp anywhere in the world, allowing you to hike to new locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/extras/Rain.gif?t=1746592045\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Inspiring Landmarks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful waterfalls, mysterious mines and more will break up the survival gameplay, allowing you to reflect on your time in the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/extras/Ponder.gif?t=1746592045\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And More!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We'll be continuing to update this <strong>About</strong> section as we build out the features in <i>On My Own: New Frontier</i>, so be sure to <u><strong>Wishlist &amp; Follow</strong></u> for the latest news updates.</p>","developers":["Beach Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693410/acac376ce600a07ed7bab39c016a9098ba54ac02/header.jpg?t=1746592045","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Legal</h2><strong>Own My Own</strong>\u00ae is a registered trademark of Weik - Close Alliance LLC (Beach Interactive).","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134012,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134012/movie480.mp4?t=174612896